    q("The colonial policy of “assimilation” is associated with", ["France, not Britain", "Britain, not France", "Portugal only", "Belgium only"], 0, "Assimilation was the French policy of making colonial subjects into French citizens. British policy was indirect rule, which preserved local institutions under supervision."),
